shift + S --will take you to the end of the line and allow you to write from there
shift + A --will delete the whole line
yy --will copy the line >> p --to paste what you just copied
y3 --will copy 3 lines below that line >> so on and so forth
d$ will delete from where the cursor is to the end of the line
dd --will delete the line
3 dd --will delete 3 lines and so on and so forth
shift + g + dd --will delete the whole file
gg --will move you to the top of a file
shift + g --will move you to the end of the file
gg + VG --will select all lines in the file
u --will undue a change you just made
ctrl + r --undue your undue
